Package: gpuq
Version: 0.1.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Maintainer: Weidows <weidows@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Weidows/gpuq
Description: Lightweight GPU job queue with WebUI + metrics
 Zero-dependency (Python stdlib) GPU task scheduler: agents submit jobs
 with (project, user, gpu, vram, priority, fallback_wait, api_key, power
 limit, ...) through a REST API / CLI; gpuq queues, runs, logs, samples
 GPU/host metrics, and shows a WebUI dashboard with charts. Includes a
 systemd unit (gpuq.service) enabled at install time.
